WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.330
Today your child hears which of the two letters starts a word.

2
00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:10.592
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:11.092 --> 00:00:13.671
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

4
00:00:14.171 --> 00:00:17.639
Each picture has its word under it, with the first letter missing.

5
00:00:18.089 --> 00:00:22.492
Say the name of the first picture. Bug. Ask: what is the first sound?

6
00:00:23.726 --> 00:00:25.079
Bat first, then ball.

7
00:00:28.243 --> 00:00:29.269
The word is bug.

8
00:00:30.169 --> 00:00:32.390
Here is one with the other letter. Dog.

9
00:00:33.719 --> 00:00:36.004
The round part first, then up and down.

10
00:00:39.401 --> 00:00:40.455
The word is dog.

11
00:00:41.355 --> 00:00:45.076
Do two pictures together. Then your child carries on with the page.

12
00:00:45.526 --> 00:00:52.120
For job two, press play on your child's listening track and step away. The voice waits, then says each word.

13
00:00:52.570 --> 00:00:55.082
At the end, your child reads three words to you.
